      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**From an idea to a finished clip**\n\n1. Type your idea into **Shot Writer**, and set the length and the number of shots.\n2. Press **Run**. A HashBidX text model writes the shot list (shown in the box below it), and the video model films it as one clip.\n\nNot happy with the shots? Press **Run** again for a new version, or copy the text into the video box and edit it by hand. The text model costs a fraction of a cent per run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**From an idea to a finished clip**\n\n1. Type your idea into **Shot Writer**, and set the length and the number of shots.\n2. Press **Run**. A HashBidX text model writes the shot list (shown in the box below it), and the video model films it as one clip.\n\nNot happy with the shots? Press **Run** again for a new version, or copy the text into the video box and edit it by hand. The text model costs a fraction of a cent per run."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
